    'NoSQL databases store and retrieve data in a format other than traditional SQL relational tables. They are designed to handle large volumes of unstructured or semi-structured data. As such they typically have fewer relational constraints and consistency checks than SQL, and claim significant benefits in terms of scalability, flexibility, and performance.' => 'Basis data NoSQL menyimpan data selain format tabel relasional SQL untuk menangani data tidak terstruktur berskala besar dengan fleksibilitas tinggi.',
